    "reasons": {
      "34": "The eye of the e is reduced to isolated pinholes in the completed-font render; the source shows an open eye.",
      "43": "26 under-replaced source-ink pixels form a visible light seam along the left stem in the trial render.",
      "59": "The e eye shrinks from a clear opening in the source to a 1–2 px dot in the trial; the right edge is ragged.",
      "64": "The e eye shrinks to a pinhole in the trial; there are 19 under-replaced pixels along the lower bowl.",
      "71": "Identity is uncertain (ornamented v or o; OCR \"o\"); per the review rule, an uncertain identity is rejected.",
      "75": "35 under-replaced pixels leave a visible seam along the bowl and left side.",
      "115": "The owned unit merges the f with the following letter; it is not the single OCR character.",
